  unitName: Gatling Soul Serin
  unitId: 820006
  unitNumber: 8192
  description: "With her trusty gun, Serin and her sister-in-arms searched the lands
    for the key to help them defeat the gods. With the promise she made to her gun,
    Serin grew desperate as it seemed nigh impossible for them to defeat the seemingly
    infinite power of the gods. She knew that if they wanted to defeat them, she
    had to be strong for her sisters. When all seemed lost, the bond with the rest
    of the Battle Maidens resonated within her, unleashing Vequa\u2019s limitless
    potential, and giving way to a tidal wave of bullets upon her enemies like it
    never has before."
  summonDesc: Since you've called upon us,<br>Vequa and I will give it our all!
  fusionDesc: The power of the waves<br>flow through me now...<br>Everyone, I won't
    let you down.
  evoDesc: Let's see where this new form takes me and Vequa. We're taking things
    even further!
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
